"@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.SeminormalDimSmall.p21","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/SeminormalDimSmall.lean#L66-L70","doc":"The partition `(2,1) ⊢ 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.SeminormalDimSmall.seminormalDim_eq_dimHLF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.SeminormalDimSmall.seminormalDim_eq_dimHLF","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/SeminormalDimSmall.lean#L56-L62","doc":"`seminormalDim` from a pinned part list, via the hook-length formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.SeminormalDimSmall.sort_eq_list","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.SeminormalDimSmall.sort_eq_list","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/SeminormalDimSmall.lean#L44-L54","doc":"**Pin a partition's sorted part list without evaluating `Multiset.sort`.**\nA sorted list is determined by its multiset, so it suffices to exhibit the list\nand check it is sorted. ","signatureChunk":0}]}